  "gate_should_answer": false,
  "pre_gate_answer": "# Markdown Briefing\n\n## Minimum Experience Requirements Recap\n\nBased strictly on the provided evidence, only **two** of the six RFPs have supportable minimum-experience requirements.\n\n### Established from the Evidence\n- **SBCERS 2020 PE RFP:**  \n  At least **one key professional** assigned to the SBCERS account must have a minimum of **10 years of experience** recommending **private equity investment programs for institutional clients**, including **3 years with the current firm**.\n\n- **TRS Illinois FY25 PE RFP:**  \n  The **primary consultant** must have a minimum of **3 years of experience** providing **private equity investment consulting services** to **public and/or private pension funds**, or other highly comparable relevant experience.\n\n### Not Established from the Provided Evidence\n- **Hawaii ERS 2017 PE RFP notice**\n- **Hawaii ERS 2022 PE RFP**\n- **Baltimore BCERS alternatives RFP**\n- **Missouri LAGERS private-markets RFP**\n\n## Bottom Line\nThe provided evidence supports reliable answers for:\n1. **SBCERS 2020:** **10 years** minimum for at least one key professional, with **3 years at the current firm**.\n2. **TRS Illinois FY25:** **3 years** minimum for the primary consultant.\n\nThe other **four RFPs cannot be answered reliably** from the supplied evidence.",
